# Line endings: the repo is authored on Windows and verified on Linux. Store
# every text file with LF so a checkout on either side produces the same bytes
# (a CRLF<->LF diff noise in a release commit is unreviewable), and keep binary
# assets untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
